      "8 An E\nJAPAN AIR LINES",
      "\"Flowers of the Seasons\" by Matazo Kayama (1929 ~)\nMatazo Kayama is one of Japan's leading painters. He has succeeded in\nproducing a decorative painting, demonstrating the technique of \"Yamato-e\"\npainting,\nwhile complementing a room of a modern super-size jet airplane.\nPlease keep this fan in commemoration of your flying JAPAN AIR LINES.\n10L2 1STE (1929~)\n=0B12\n2074734202887-\n24CB0SNAO-BERDAORS\n- 21•252.39\nRESORTELE"
